  "locales": {
    "en": {
      "trackName": "Sudoku – Puzzle Game Daily",
      "description": "Classic Sudoku gameplay.\nEndless quality problems.\nChallenges every day.\nMultiple Sudoku patterns.\nWorldwide ranking battles.\n\nDare to take on the challenge of Classic Sudoku, the quintessential numerical brain teaser, designed to give you a refreshing workout for your brain while offering an exhilarating logic puzzle escapade!\n\nWith roots tracing back to the 18th century, Sudoku is a timeless mathematical game that rigorously tests your logical acumen and reasoning prowess. Our carefully designed Sudoku game provides you with a vast array of superior puzzles, diverse gameplay styles, and multiple levels of challenges. Immerse yourself in the satisfaction of puzzle-solving, stimulate your brain, and boost your logical potential.\n\nThe Sudoku grid is a matrix of nine squares, each further partitioned into nine cells. Based on provided clues, you are tasked with filling the remaining spaces using logic and reasoning. Each row, column, and thick-lined 3x3 square must include numbers 1-9 without any repetition. Embedded within these straightforward rules lies limitless challenges and excitement.\n\nIn addition to the traditional 9x9 Sudoku, our game presents numerous Sudoku variants including Diagonal Sudoku, Window Sudoku, External Clue Sudoku, and Skyscraper Sudoku. These unique gameplay styles introduce a whole new realm of challenges and experiences.\n\nOur Sudoku game is packed with a variety of enjoyable features to provide a supreme gaming experience:\n- Eye-pleasing and minimalistic visual aesthetics with a selection of skins for a visual feast.\n- Daily puzzle contests with fresh puzzles launched daily across three difficulty tiers. Accumulate stars and secure monthly trophies.\n- Robust save option that enables pausing/continuing the game at will. Unfinished games are auto-saved, so you can resume at your leisure.\n- Comprehensive data statistics tracking your gameplay history. Reflect on your Sudoku journey and monitor your advancement.\n- Extensive tutorial guidance to aid your understanding of Sudoku strategies and puzzle-solving hacks.\n- Various gameplay styles featuring different rulesets for a varied gaming pleasure.\n- Multiple difficulty levels from novice to expert, accommodating players of varying skills, be it a beginner or a Sudoku master.\n- An array of support features, like auto-highlighting of identical numbers. Enable or disable as per your preference, customizing your gameplay experience.\n- Online PvP feature, compete with Sudoku aficionados across the globe and flaunt your puzzle-solving talents.\n\nRegardless of being a Sudoku rookie or a seasoned fan, our Sudoku game guarantees a blend of enjoyment and challenges. Get our Sudoku game today, test your limits, exercise your brain, and relish in infinite logic puzzle entertainment!",
      "releaseNotes": "超好玩的数独游戏！\n专为移动设备操作优化体验\n修复已知问题，欢迎下载体验！",
